commit 91ed5738b0a57a57b4e849d526a5e017100d52cf

C03: the CDP page read and tab listing declare that a read observes no effect (WEB1543)

WEB1541 measured that the reviewed page read was proposed, approved by the root reviewer and executed over the root fixture, but the kernel failed it: the browser.page.read descriptor, privacy-sensitive, inherited the default that a non-read-only operation must observe an effect, and the CDP adapter truthfully reports that a read observes none (external_verification_failed / external_effect_unobserved). browser.page.read and browser.tabs.list now declare requiresObservedEffect: false, like ocr.read; nothing else in the catalog changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


